comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-04T14:21:06.966Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check evidence: all-status searches for tracker measurement, ratchet, population, dependency-kind aliases, blocks/blocked_by, and related_to found this item as the canonical arbitrary-population owner; pm-kpftft remains the distinct repository validate/health baseline owner and is bundled rather than duplicated."
  "2026-08-04T14:52:20.478Z","harness:codex","Evidence 2026-08-04: implemented a generic shrinking-only tracker measurement gate with exhaustive pm validate warning and pm health check classes, dependency-kind and graph-profile ceilings, terminal-owner retirement, fail-closed update behavior, bounded mutation attribution receipts, and a sandbox negative control. Wired it into quality:static, mandatory CI, and the release gate registry. Verification passed: 432 files / 6836 tests; coverage 100% statements (48644/48644), branches (35239/35239), functions (9955/9955), lines (47149/47149); quality:static; typecheck; docs/links; secret scan; pnpm audit; package artifact gate; 88-command package-first dogfood; packed npx smoke; isolated packed Bun install/init/create/search. The first static run observed a 193ms query import against a 172ms ceiling; unchanged exact rerun and the full suite passed without altering the ceiling, identifying environment variance rather than accepting regression."
  "2026-08-04T15:43:12.041Z","harness:codex","Review evidence: DeepScan PR #894 reports three records, all the same INSUFFICIENT_NULL_CHECK in dependency contributor attribution. All-status search found pm-ips23h as the canonical implementation owner; no duplicate analyzer item was created."
  "2026-08-04T16:11:14.682Z","harness:codex","Review remediation evidence 2026-08-04: PR #894 DeepScan findings were three duplicate reports for one nullable dependency-contributor access. Replaced optional-chain narrowing with explicit object/null guards and guarded measuredOn/createdAt locals; malformed null and scalar dependency rows are covered. Linked suite passed 47/47, full repository coverage passed 6838/6838 at 100% statements/branches/functions/lines, and CI-mode quality:static passed all 19 live ratchets."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-04T14:53:37.047Z","harness:codex","A tracker measurement becomes durable project context only when selector, ceiling, owner, provenance, and retirement semantics are executable. Exhaustive sources must fail on undeclared keys, while bounded mutation receipts keep regression output actionable and token-efficient."
